  "prompt": {
    "zh": "极简几何风格，低多边形白模质感，浅色纸面背景（冷白 #EBF4FB / 米白 #EFEEED），只用一个墨灰（#445054~#6A696B）加一个青绿（#67999A / #70ACB3），大留白，细线描边，无渐变无阴影无高光，等距视角，干净的 UI 布局，克制的几何装饰。",
    "en": "minimal geometric art style, low-poly untextured clay-model look, paper-white background (cool white #EBF4FB / warm off-white #EFEEED), duotone palette: one ink grey (#445054-#6A696B) + one teal accent (#67999A / #70ACB3), generous negative space, thin clean outlines, flat shading only — no gradients, no drop shadows, no specular highlights, isometric composition, tidy minimal UI layout, restrained geometric ornaments, muted desaturated look.",
    "negative": "dark background, neon glow, cyberpunk, photorealistic, painterly, heavy textures, colorful gradients, busy particles, lens flare, drop shadow, bevelled edges, high saturation rainbow palette"
  },
